<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Neuro-chord</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background-color: #0f172a;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #f8fafc;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background-color: #1e293b;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1 0%, #a855f7 100%);
            padding: 50px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.025em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px 35px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .welcome-text {
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #f1f5f9;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .name-highlight {
            color: #818cf8;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .description {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .button-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }
        .btn {
            background-color: #6366f1;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            padding: 16px 32px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            display: inline-block;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #475569;
            border-top: 1px solid #1e293b;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #6366f1;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Neuro-chord</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p class="welcome-text">Hi <span class="name-highlight">{{name}}</span>,</p>
            
            <p class="description">
                Your connection to the <strong>Neuro-chord</strong> network has been successfully established. We're thrilled to have you on board!
            </p>